<title>USA: Castle Harlan says raises $610 mln in new fund.</title>
<headline>Castle Harlan says raises $610 mln in new fund.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchant bank Castle Harlan Inc said Monday it has received $610 million in commitments for a new fund, its third private equity investment partnership.</p>
<p>Jeffrey Siegel, managing director, said investors include public and private pension funds, private foundations, college endowments and indivuduals.</p>
<p>The fund was oversubscribed by more than $100 million, after it was capped at $610 million, he said.</p>
